tamp": "01:26:51", "text": "等等，这是哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5214.39, "timestamp": "01:26:54", "text": "哦，对。 它被锁住了。 封锁措施已"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5216.79, "timestamp": "01:26:56", "text": "生效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5218.95, "timestamp": "01:26:58", "text": "受保护的 Xfill。"}]